[P_03_Chemical_Communications]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Lambert: Remember, we're under a cease-fire agreement with North Korea while they meet allied demands to withdrawal from Seoul. Keep it discrete. We don't want to re-ignite the war.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=LAMBERT: Stay calm. It's a test launch, scheduled long before the war broke out. The DPRK is just reminding us that they mean business. It also happens to be your best way inside the bunker.
POPUPMESSAGE_0015=Infiltrate the bunker down one of the silos.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=LAMBERT: Good lord. That all but proves it. They must have a specific agent in mind if they are conducting payload thermographic tests. Recover the viral protocol from their main lab so we can analyze it.
POPUPMESSAGE_0016=Recover the viral protocol from the main laboratory.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=LAMBERT: That's a protocol for a viral based bio-weapon. From the looks of it, we'll need a serum sample from one of their monkeys in order to test both their virus and their anti-virus.
POPUPMESSAGE_0017=Acquire the appropriate chimpanzee blood serum needed for the antidote.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=LAMBERT: Well, you're thinking ahead... maybe whatever experiments they're conducting on these monkeys are part of their viral protocol.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0013L=LAMBERT: That's a protocol for a viral based bio-weapon. Take that serum and test it against the anti-virus they have stored in their cryogenic chamber.
POPUPMESSAGE_0018=A sample of the anti-virus must be manufactured from the protocol and recovered from the cryogenic chamber.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=LAMBERT: Good. Now take that serum and test it against the anti-virus they have stored in their cryogenic chamber.
POPUPMESSAGE_0019=A sample of the anti-virus must be manufactured from the protocol and recovered from the cryogenic chamber.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=LAMBERT: You're going to need to follow the protocol to manufacture a sample of the anti-virus.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=LAMBERT: Good. It looks like the anti-virus is stable. You'll need to get to the top of the cryochamber so one of you can recover the sample.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=LAMBERT: Good job. If we can get this to the CDC, they can institute a response plan in the event this weapon is used against our troops. The last thing we need is a sample of the virus itself in weaponized form. You need to find a way into the warhead storage room you passed through earlier in order to recover a sample.
Note_0022L=A missile in the storage bay contains the virus sample you need.
POPUPMESSAGE_0020=Retrieve a viral sample from one of the missiles.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=LAMBERT: Good work. I suggest you be careful with that stuff. Make your way to the moorage down below and avail yourselves of some transportation. We'll pick you up from open water.
POPUPMESSAGE_0021=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=LAMBERT: Good thinking. If CDC can see the procedure they used in the operation, it'll make figuring out the exact nature of the virus a lot easier.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0012L=LAMBERT: We can't extract you until your objectives are complete. Get back in there and finish the mission.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0014L=LAMBERT: Damn. That is exactly the kind of news I didn't want to hear... a rogue Colonel with bio weapons and an agenda.

