[P_03_Chemical_InterroGuard]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Oh, no... you must be the Americans. I knew this day would come. Look, don't kill me... the code for the main lab is 8416...
Note_0003L=The key code to open the security port of the main lab is 8416

[P_03_Chemical_InterroTech]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Oh, god. Please... no... I'm just a scientist. I just take care of the monkeys. I'll tell you everything. The code for the mini-lab is 5791... you'll find what you're looking for in there.
Speech_0002L=Oh... please don't kill me. The mini-lab code is 5791 and the code for the fridge inside is 1423. Please... I didn't do anything wrong.
Note_0003L=The key code into the mini lab is 5791

