Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0018L=Is the zodiac all fueled up?
Speech_0019L=Fueled and ready to go.
Speech_0020L=Good. If the Americans find out about this place, they certainly won't let the missile boat out of here intact. We'll take the zodiac and hopefully not get bombed.
Speech_0021L=Good idea. I'm with you.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0022L=Under interrogation by Special agent Jack Baxter, Jong Pom-chu confessed his involvement in delivering highly classified bio-weapon research to agents of the CGIB. CGIB then blackmailed him into acquire heavily regulated v So, what does it say? Viral engineering equipment which he smuggled through Panama on their behalf. Our investigation of Jong's reported telecommunications activities over the last few months makes it clear that the North Korean government may be using his intelligence and his equipment to manufacture biological weapons in a series of old bunkers near Namp'o-si. Your mission is infiltrate the bunker complex, identify any chemical or biological weapons, and recover samples of any agents being developed.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0023L=Long Dan, the Chinese ambassador to the US, has been praised for his diplomatic effort in bringing about a cease-fire in the Korean War. Even as American and North and South Korean forces face an uneasy stand-off in still-occupied Seoul, diplomats return to the bargaining table for an emergency session. 
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0024L=In other news, 141 of the bodies recovered from the Walsh incident arrived in the United States today in preparation for funeral services due to commence the day after tomorrow. The USS Walsh is now confirmed lost with all hands, leaving the death toll at a staggering 283 crewman and officers.
