[P_03_Chemical_MissileRoomChat01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0024L=So, what does it say?
Speech_0025L=Loading... thirty-seven point one. Launch... spikes at thirty-seven point six. Flight... hmm... we range from thirty-seven point five when on-board convection begins, down to... thirty-six point four just before limit.
Speech_0035L=That's all well within our delta two degrees. What about terminal?
Speech_0036L=It normalizes perfectly at terminal. Exactly thirty-seven degrees.
Speech_0037L=Exactly body temperature.
Speech_0038L=Giving an aerated half life of four hours and a twenty percent infection rate over sixteen hours.
Speech_0039L=I'd call that a success.
Speech_0040L=Are you kidding. If there was a Nobel Prize for weapons research, we'd have just won it.
Speech_0041L=Maybe we'll get a commendation from Colonel Kim.
Speech_0042L=Didn't you hear? The Colonel disappeared. He was ordered to report to General Po, but he never showed up.
Speech_0043L=What?!
Speech_0044L=He accused the General of cow-towing to the Chinese bureaucrats at the expense of five thousand loyal troops.
Speech_0045L=Well... it's kind of true.
Speech_0046L=Rumor is he took the viral cultures and is threatening to weaponize them to fight the war single-handedly.
Speech_0047L=Hm. Well, good thing this bunker is hardened against bio-agents.
Speech_0048L=I'll say.

[P_03_Chemical_MissileRoomSleepG]

