[P_03_Chemical_WarehouseChat]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=Are you cold?
Speech_0009L=No. It's only really cold inside the cryo-chamber.
Speech_0010L=Then why are your teeth chattering.
Speech_0011L=Because I'm scared of the bio-weapons they keep inside the cryo-chamber.
Speech_0012L=Really? I heard they were pretty humane.
Speech_0013L=If by humane you mean six hours of having your immune system turn against you, liquefy your internal organs and cause you to explosively hemorrhage infectious goop out of every orifice until you boil to death, sure.
Speech_0016L=Oh. Nevermind.

